---

layouts/crest.json and layouts/crest.svg (renamed from herdr-t3.json and
herdr-t3.svg), keys.json (in part) and mods/t3-* come from herdr-t3
(https://github.com/JinJieBeWater/herdr-t3) by JinJieBeWater, under the Apache
License 2.0 (licenses/herdr-t3-APACHE-2.0.txt). The mods/t3-* folders are
copies of upstream commit a790cc280cfbc27e856672edb457e3ee4061cd92; only
mods/t3-chrome/main.js is changed (the layout's name, herdr-t3 to crest).
layouts/crest.json and keys.json were modified as README.md describes
("How it differs from herdr-t3").

themes/tokyo-night.json uses the colours of Tokyo Night
(https://github.com/folke/tokyonight.nvim), MIT, Copyright (c) Folke Lemaitre.

mods/files-t3 is a copy of the Files mod that ships with Herdr
(https://herdr.dev), with its corners and outline changed.

Parts of mods/review-pane (scroller.js, zoom.js, paint.js, and the shapes and
base-branch guess in engine.js) come from herdr-gitview
(https://github.com/ChmaraX/herdr-gitview), under this license:

